# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# NOTE: do NOT ignore `dist` here. pulse-core is consumed as a git dependency,
# and this nested .gitignore would exclude the built UI (frontend/dist) from
# what npm packs, even though it's in package.json "files". The built UI is
# still kept out of commits by the root .gitignore's `frontend/dist/`.
dist-ssr
*.local

